<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HOS" style="id">RRK28.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">HOSEA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Nabi Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hos</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA NABI</para>
  <para style="mt1">HOSEA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HOS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:23">2 Bag 14:23</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:1">15:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:1">Isa 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:1">Amo 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 1:1">Mik 1:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki n'ekigambo kya MUKAMA ekyaizire ahari Hosea mwene Beeri omu busingye bwa Uziya, Yosamu, Ahazi na Hezekia abagabe ba Yuda, n'omu busingye bwa Yeroboamu mwene Yoashi omugabe wa Israeli.<verse eid="HOS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okushushanisibwa n'omukazi maraaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 16:15-17">Ezk 16:15-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA obu yaatandika kugamba naaraba omuri Hosea, akamugira ati: Irooko, oshwere omukazi maraaya, ozaare abaana b'obwamaraaya, ahabw'okuba ensi egi erengyesereize kukora obwamaraaya ahabw'okutsigaho MUKAMA. <verse eid="HOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 1:3" />Nawe nikwo kugyenda akashwera Gomeri muhara wa Dibulaimu, akagira enda, akazaara omwana w'omwojo.<verse eid="HOS 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 1:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 10:11">2 Bag 10:11</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:8-12">15:8-12</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 7:9">Amo 7:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Eiziina rye omwete Yezereeli; ahabw'okuba hatsigaire omwanya mukye, nkafubira enju ya Yehu ahabw'eshagama ei yaasheesheire Yezereeli, kandi ndyamariraho kimwe obugabe bw'enju ya Israeli. <verse eid="HOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:29">2 Bag 15:29</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba ndyahendera obuta bwa Israeli omu ruhita rwa Yezereeli.<verse eid="HOS 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 17:6">2 Bag 17:6</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:10">1 Pet 2:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogwo mukazi yaagaruka yaagira enda, yaazaara omwishiki. MUKAMA yaagira Hosea ati: Eiziina rye omwete Lo-ruhama, amakuru ngu Okutagirirwa mbabazi; ahabw'okuba tindigaruka kugirira nju ya Israeli embabazi, kubasaasira na kakye. <verse eid="HOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:35">2 Bag 19:35</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:6">Zek 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:10">9:10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka enju ya Yuda yo, ndyagigirira embabazi, mbajunise MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo; tindibajunisa buta, rurara, rugamba, mbaraasi, n'obu baakuba abazigyenderaho. <verse eid="HOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 1:8" />Ku yaacuukize Lo-ruhama, yaagaruka yaagira enda, yaazaara omwana w'omwojo. <verse eid="HOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Lev 26:12</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Eiziina rye omwete Lo-ami, amakuru ngu Ti bantu bangye; ahabw'okuba timuri bantu bangye, kandi naanye tindi Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="HOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:17">Kut 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:4">Isa 62:4</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:26">Rom 9:26</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:18">2 Kor 6:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka omubaro gw'Abaisraeli guryaingana n'omusheenyi gw'aha nyanja ogutarikubaasa kurengwa n'obu kwakuba okubarwa; kandi omu mwanya ahu baagambiriirwe ngu, Timuri bantu bangye, niho barigambirirwa ngu, Muri abaana ba Ruhanga ohuriire. <verse eid="HOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:18">Yer 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:23">Ezk 34:23</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:16-24">37:16-24</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 3:5">Hos 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:6">Zek 10:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Abayuda n'Abaisraeli baryateeranirwa hamwe, beetooranire omwebembezi omwe, kandi baryainamuka barugye omuri egyo nsi; ahabw'okuba ekiro kya Yezereeli kiryaba kikuru.<verse eid="HOS 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HOS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okufubirwa ahabw'obushambani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1, 2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 50:1">Isa 50:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Gira mwene sho oti: Ami; na munyaanyoko omugire oti: Ruhama.<verse eid="HOS 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 2:2" />Tongana na nyoko, tongana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:2">Ahabw'okuba ti mukazi wangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:2">Naanye tindi iba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:2">Aihe obwamaraaya mu maisho ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:2">N'obushambani bwe ahagati y'amabeere ge,<verse eid="HOS 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 2:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 19:13">Ezk 19:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ntakaamujweka busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:3">Nkamugira nk'obu yaazaarwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:3">Nkamuhindura nk'eihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:3">Nkamugira nk'ensi ekarangataine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:3">Nkamwitsa eiriho.<verse eid="HOS 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 2:4" />Kandi tindigirira baana be mbabazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:4">Ahabw'okuba n'ab'obwamaraaya.<verse eid="HOS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 2:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 44:17">Yer 44:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Na nyinabo akaraaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:5">Kandi owaagizire enda yaabo akakora eby'obuhemu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:5">Ahabw'okuba akagira ati: Ndyayekuratira nkunzi zangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:5">Ezimpa eky'okurya n'eky'okunywa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:5">Ebyoya by'entaama na furakisi, amajuta n'eby'okunywa.<verse eid="HOS 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 2:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 3:23">Yob 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 19:8">19:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo naaza kwitsiza omuhanda gwe amahwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:6">Nkazitira orugo rw'okumuzibira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:6">Akabura oburabo.<verse eid="HOS 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 2:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 54:5">Isa 54:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 54:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 15:17">Luk 15:17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 15:18">18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryakuratira nkunzi ze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:7">Kwonka tarizihika;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:7">Aryazisherura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:7">Kwonka tarizibona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:7">Bwanyima aryagira ati: Kangyende,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:7">Ngarukire omushaija wangye ow'okubanza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:7">Ahabw'okuba obwo nkaba ndi gye okukira hati.<verse eid="HOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:3">Isa 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:19">Ezk 16:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka taramanyire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:8">Ku niinye naabaire mmuha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:8">Oburo, viinyo n'amajuta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:8">Nkamukanyisiza efeeza n'ezaabu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:8">Ezi baakoreseize Baali.<verse eid="HOS 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 1:10">Yoel 1:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo ndimwakira oburo bwangye omu igyesha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:9">Na viinyo yangye omu mweru gwayo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:9">Kandi ndyamwaka ebyoya by'entaama byangye na furakisi yangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:9">Ebyabaire biri eby'okushweka enjuuro ye.<verse eid="HOS 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 2:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LAM 1:8">Tonz 1:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu niinyija kworeka butunu obushambani bwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:10">Omu maisho ga nkunzi ze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:10">Tihariho n'omwe orimuunyaka.<verse eid="HOS 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 2:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:13">Isa 1:13</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 1:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 8:10">Amo 8:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ndyamumaraho ebirikumushemeza byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:11">Amagyenyi ge, eby'emboneko ze z'ameezi, sabato ze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:11">N'amagyenyi goona agatairweho.<verse eid="HOS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:5">Isa 5:5</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 1:7">Mik 1:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ndyacwekyereza emizaabibu ye n'emitiini ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:12">Ebi yaabaire agambaho naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:12">Ebi n'ebihembo byangye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:12">Ebi naahairwe nkunzi zangye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:12">Byona ndyabihindura ekibira, biriirwe kimwe enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa.<verse eid="HOS 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 23:40">Ezk 23:40</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyamufubira, mmuture amagyenyi ga Baabaali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:13">Abu yaabaire ayooterera obubaane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:13">Akeehunda empeta omu matu n'amahunde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:13">Akakuratira nkunzi ze;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:13">Haza nyowe akanyebwa;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HOS 2:13">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="HOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okugarura Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 2:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:2">Isa 40:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:35">Ezk 20:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo reeba, niinyija kumweshengyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:14">Mmureete omu ihamba, ngambe gye nawe.<verse eid="HOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 2:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:2">Yer 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hos 11:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi okwo niyo ndimuheera emizaabibu ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:15">N'oruhanga rwa Akori nkarugira eirembo ry'amatsiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:15">Akeetabirayo Ruhanga nk'omu biro by'obuhangare bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:15">Nk'omu bunaku obu yaarugiiremu omu nsi ya Misri.<verse eid="HOS 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 2:16" />MUKAMA naagira ati: Eryo izooba oryanyeta Ishi, amakuru ngu Ibanye; oryaba otakiinyeta Baali, amakuru ngu Mukama wangye; <verse eid="HOS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:13">Kur 23:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 1:4">Zef 1:4</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba ndyaiha omu kanwa ke amaziina ga Baabaali, garekye kugambwaho obundi. <verse eid="HOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 2:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:5">Lev 26:5</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 5:23">Yob 5:23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:4">Isa 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:25">Ezk 34:25</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 39:9">39:9</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 39:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba ndyakuragaanira endagaano n'enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa n'amahungu g'omu mwanya kandi n'ebirikwekurura ahansi, mmareho obuta na rurara n'orugamba omu nsi, nkureetere kubyama ogaramisiriize. <verse eid="HOS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:14">Yer 3:14</ref>, <ref loc="JER 3:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 11:2">2 Kor 11:2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyakwegambira obugyenyi, obe owangye ebiro byona, nkwegambire obugyenyi omu kuhikiirira, omu bwinganisa, omu kukunda n'omu mbabazi. <verse eid="HOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HOS 2:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:34">Yer 31:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17:3">Yoh 17:3</ref>. </char></note> Ndyakwegambira obugyenyi omu bwesigwa, obone kumanya MUKAMA.<verse eid="HOS 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HOS 2:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 8:12">Zek 8:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA naagira ati: Eryo izooba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:21">Ndyayetaba eiguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:21">Naryo ryetabe ensi,<verse eid="HOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HOS 2:22" />Ensi eyetabe oburo na viinyo n'amajuta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:22">Nabyo byetabe Yezereeli.<verse eid="HOS 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HOS 2:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:33">Yer 31:33</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:9">Ezk 36:9</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 1:6">Hos 1:6</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 1:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 13:9">Zek 13:9</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:25">Rom 9:25</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 9:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:10">1 Pet 2:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyamwebibira omu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:23">Ngirire embabazi otakazigirirwaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:23">Ngambire abaabaire batari bangye nti: Muri abantu bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:23">Nabo bagarukyemu bati: Ori Ruhanga waitu.<verse eid="HOS 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HOS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ebya rukundo ei Ruhanga akunda Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="SNG 2:5">Kyesh 2:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yangira ati: Irooko, ogarukye okunde ogwo mukazi orikukundwa nkunzi ye endiijo, kandi enshambani, nk'oku MUKAMA akunda Abaisraeli, n'obu baraabe bakuratira baaruhanga abandi, bakakunda ebiihuro by'emizaabibu eyomire. <verse eid="HOS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:16">Lev 27:16</ref>. </char></note> Nikwo kumucunguza shekeli z'efeeza ikumi na itaano, na homeri ya sayiri. <verse eid="HOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:13">Bir 21:13</ref>. </char></note> Naamugira nti: Noija kumara ebiro bingi ori owangye; torigaruka kuraaya, n'obu kwakuba okuba omukazi w'ondiijo mushaija; kandi naanye nikwo ndiba ahariiwe. <verse eid="HOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 17:5">Bar 17:5</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 10:1">Hos 10:1</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 10:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba Abaisraeli baryamara ebiro bingi bataine mugabe nari omutegyeki, bataine bitambo n'obu yaakuba enyomyo, kandi bataine efodi, n'obu zaakuba terafiimu. <verse eid="HOS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:5">Yer 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:4">50:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:24">Ezk 34:24</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 1:11">Hos 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:17">Mik 7:17</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Abaisraeli baryagaruka, basherure MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo n'omugabe waabo Daudi, baije ahari MUKAMA n'obwoba, n'aha burungi bwe omu biro by'aha muheru.<verse eid="HOS 3:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HOS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okumanyisa Abaisraeli ebibi byabo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 3:13">Isa 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:31">Yer 25:31</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:2">Mik 6:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe Baisraeli 'mwe, nimuhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:1">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA naatonganisa abatuuzi b'omuri egi nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:1">Naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:1">Omu nsi egi tiharimu bwesigwa, nari embabazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:1">N'obu kwakuba okumanya Ruhanga;<verse eid="HOS 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 4:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 7:1">Hos 7:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kureka okurahira, okubeiha, okwita, okwiba n'okushambana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:2">Abantu n'ebyegyengye; kandi okwita nikukuratwa okundi.<verse eid="HOS 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 4:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 24:4">Isa 24:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:28">Yer 4:28</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 1:10">Yoel 1:10</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 1:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 1:3">Zef 1:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo ensi neecura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:3">N'abagitwiremu boona nibahwamu amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:3">Kandi n'enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:3">N'enyonyi z'omu mwanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:3">Nangwa n'eby'enyanja nibiihwaho.<verse eid="HOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 4:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 17:12">Bir 17:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka hatagira owaatongana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:4">Kandi hatagira owaatabaaza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:4">Ahakuba iwe munyamurwa 'we, niiwe ndikutonganisa.<verse eid="HOS 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 4:5" />Oryateera entsibo nyomushana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:5">Na nabi ateere entsibo naiwe nyekiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:5">Kandi ndyacwekyereza nyoko.<verse eid="HOS 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 4:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 1:29">Enf 1:29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:13">Isa 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:39">Yer 23:39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu bangye nibacwekyerezibwa ahabw'okubura okumanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:6">Naiwe ahabw'okwanga okumanya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:6">Naanye niinyanga ku oba omunyamurwa wangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:6">Kandi nk'oku oyebirwe ebiragiro bya Ruhanga waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:6">Naanye ndyayebwa abaana baawe.<verse eid="HOS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 2:9">Mal 2:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ei bagarukiire kukanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:7">Niyo bagarukiire kuncumuraho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:7">Ekitiinisa kyabo niinyija kukihindura okuhemuka.<verse eid="HOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 4:8" />Nibatungwa ekibi ky'abantu bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:8">Nibaruruuhira eby'okushiisha byabo.<verse eid="HOS 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 4:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 24:2">Isa 24:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omunyamurwa n'abantu nikyo kimwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:9">Ndyabafubira ahabw'emitwarize yaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:9">Mbazimuurire ahabw'ebi baakozire.<verse eid="HOS 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 4:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAG 1:6">Hag 1:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryarya, kwonka tibarihaaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:10">Baryaraaya, kwonka tibarikanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:10">Ahabw'okuba barekire kweta ahari MUKAMA.<verse eid="HOS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 4:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 11:4">1 Bag 11:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwamaraaya, amaarwa n'amaarwa g'omutahe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:11">Biita omutima.<verse eid="HOS 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 4:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:27">Yer 2:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu bangye nibeehanuuza aha biti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:12">N'enkoni zaabo nizo zirikuragura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:12">Ahabw'okuba omutima gw'obwamaraaya gubahabize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:12">Baatsigaho Ruhanga waabo, baaza kuraaya.<verse eid="HOS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:29">Isa 1:29</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 6:13">Ezk 6:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nibatambira ebitambo aha mitwe y'enshozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:13">Booterera obubaane aha bibungo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:13">Ahansi y'emyela n'emilebene n'emyalooni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:13">Ahabw'okugira ekicuucu kirungi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HOS 4:13" />
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:13">Nikyo bahara baanyu baabeereire baamaraaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:13">N'abagore baanyu bakashambana.<verse eid="HOS 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 4:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 9:10">Hos 9:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bahara baanyu ku bariraaya, tindibafubira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:14">N'obu baakuba abagore baanyu ku barishambana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:14">Ahabw'okuba n'abashaija bo bonka nibeekiika aha rubaju na baamaraaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:14">Batamba ebitambo bakwataniise n'enshambani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:14">N'ahabw'ekyo eihanga eritaine kwetegyereza, riryahwerekyerera.<verse eid="HOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 4:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 9:15">Hos 9:15</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 12:11">12:11</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 12:29">1 Bag 12:29</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 4:4">Amo 4:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Israeli, waabaire maraaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:15">Omanye otasiisira Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:15">Otaza omuri Gilugaali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:15">Otainamuka Besaveeni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:15">N'obu kwakuba okurahira oti, Nindahira MUKAMA ohuriire.<verse eid="HOS 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 4:16" />Nk'enyana etarikutsimbuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:16">Nikwo na Israeli ari empiga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:16">Nimugira ngu MUKAMA naabaasa kubariisa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:16">Nk'omwana gw'entaama oguri omu iriisizo rihango?<verse eid="HOS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 4:17" />Efuraimu ayehongyeire ebishushani ebirikuramibwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:17">Mumurugyeho.<verse eid="HOS 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 4:18" />N'ekigombe ky'abasinzi, nibeehayo kuraaya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:18">Nibakunda okuhemuka okukira ekitiinisa.<verse eid="HOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 4:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 13:15">Hos 13:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:29">Isa 1:29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:13">57:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:11">Yer 4:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuyaga gubabumbatiire omu mapapa gaagwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:19">Baryaitwa enshoni ahabw'amatambiro gaabo.<verse eid="HOS 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HOS 5" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okuteisa abanyamurwa n'abategyeki abaareeteire Israeli okugiibwaho ebifubiro</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 9:8">Hos 9:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe banyamurwa 'mwe, nimuhurire eki;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:1">Naimwe ab'enju ya Israeli, mutegye amatu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:1">Kandi naimwe ab'enju y'omugabe nimuhurire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:1">Ahabw'okuba orubanja n'orwanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:1">Mubaire omutego ahari Mizipa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:1">N'ekigoye ekitegire ahari Tabora.<verse eid="HOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 5:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 9:9">Hos 9:9</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 9:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:21">Zab 50:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obusya bwa Shitimu babutimbire, bwahika okuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:2">Kwonka boona dyabahana.<verse eid="HOS 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 5:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 3:2">Amo 3:2</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:12">5:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Efuraimu nimmumanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:3">Na Israeli tanyesherekire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:3">Ahakuba iwe, Efuraimu, hati obaire maraaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:3">Israeli yaasiisikara.<verse eid="HOS 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 5:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:2">Isa 59:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebi barikukora tibirikubareka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:4">Kugarukira Ruhanga waabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:4">Ahabw'okuba omutima gw'obwamaraaya gubarimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:4">Tibarikumanya MUKAMA.<verse eid="HOS 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 5:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 7:10">Hos 7:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amaryo ga Israeli niwe mushinja we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:5">Efuraimu aryateerera entsibo omu kutahikiirira kwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:5">Kandi na Yuda aryateera entsibo hamwe nabo.<verse eid="HOS 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 9:12">Hos 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:11">Isa 1:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryagyenda n'amasyo gaabo g'ente n'ag'entaama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:6">Kusherura MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:6">Kwonka tibarimubona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:6">Ahabw'okuba abarugireho.<verse eid="HOS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 5:7" />Bareebize MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:7">Ahabw'okuba abaana abu baazaire n'abanyamahanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:7">Nibaija kumirwa juba n'emisiri yaabo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:7">Okwezi kutakabonekire.<verse eid="HOS 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 5:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:5">Yer 4:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muteerere enzamba omuri Gibea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:8">N'eikondere omuri Raama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:8">Muteerere enduuru Besaveeni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:8">Iwe Benyamiini, tetema!<verse eid="HOS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 5:9" />Efuraimu neija kuhinduka eihamba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:9">Aha izooba ry'okufubirirwaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:9">Nindanga omu nganda za israeli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:9">Ekitaribura kubaho.<verse eid="HOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 5:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 19:14">Bir 19:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abanyiginya ba Yuda bahindukire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:10">Nk'abarikukuura ebiti by'emyatano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:10">Ndyabashukaho ekiniga kyangye nk'amaizi.<verse eid="HOS 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 5:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 7:11">Hos 7:11</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:33">Bir 28:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Efuraimu naahatwa, asingyereirwe omu rubanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:11">Ahabw'okuba akamariirira kukuratira ebitaine mugasho.<verse eid="HOS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:28">Yob 13:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo mbeerereire Efuraimu nk'ekiyenje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:12">N'enju ya Yuda nk'emungu.<verse eid="HOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 5:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 14:3">Hos 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:19">2 Bag 15:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:5">Isa 1:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 1:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Efuraimu ku yaareebire endwara ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:13">Na Yuda yaareeba obuhuta bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:13">Efuraimu yaaza Asiria,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:13">Yaatuma aha mugabe Yarebu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:13">Kwonka tarikubaasa kubakiza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:13">N'obu kwakuba okutamba obuhuta bwanyu.<verse eid="HOS 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 5:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 13:7">Hos 13:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba ndyabeera Efuraimu nk'entare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:14">Mbeere enju ya Yakobo nk'omugunju gwayo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:14">Nyowe, nyowe nyenka, niinyija kutaagura, nyegyendere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:14">Ntware eki nyitsire, habure ow'okukijuna.<verse eid="HOS 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 5:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 26:16">Isa 26:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:10-12">Yer 29:10-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyagyenda, nyegarukire omu mwanya gwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:15">Okuhitsya obu baryemera ekicumuro kyabo, bakansherura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:15">Omu kubonabona kwabo nimwo barinsherurira.<verse eid="HOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HOS 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuhuguura Abaefuraimu okumugarukira</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 14:1">Hos 14:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:26">Isa 30:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:1">Nimwije, tugarukire MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:1">Ahabw'okuba niwe yaatuhutaize, kandi niwe aritutambira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:1">Niwe yaatuteire, kandi niwe aritushemba.<verse eid="HOS 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 6:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 71:20">Zab 71:20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:27">Luk 24:27</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:44">44</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebiro bibiri, aryatuhimbuura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:2">Kandi aha kiro kya kashatu aryatuzoora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:2">Tubone kuguma turi abahuriire omu maisho ge.<verse eid="HOS 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 6:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 4:6">Hos 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 14:5">14:5</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:23">Yoel 2:23</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik 5:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ka tumanye MUKAMA, tugumizemu kumumanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:3">Okwija kwe ni nk'omushekye, tikuribura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:3">Aryatuhikaho nk'enjura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:3">Nke'njura ya katumba erikwitirira eitaka.<verse eid="HOS 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 6:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:2">Yer 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 11:8">Hos 11:8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:3">13:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Efuraimu, mbwenu nkugire nta?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:4">Iwe Yuda, nkugire nta?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:4">Okukunda kwawe ni nk'ekicu ky'omu kasheeshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:4">Ni nk'orume orutsya bukiri kare.<verse eid="HOS 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 6:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 4:12">Heb 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:29">Yer 23:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo naabakondeseize baanabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:5">Nkabaita n'ebigambo by'omu kanwa kangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:5">Kandi emanja zangye ezi ncwa ni nk'omushana ogubuga hoona;<verse eid="HOS 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 6:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 15:22">1 Sam 15:22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:13">Mat 9:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:7">12:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba eki ndikwenda n'embabazi, ti bitambo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:6">Kandi okumanya Ruhanga, nkukunda okukira ebitambo byokize.<verse eid="HOS 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 6:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 5:7">Hos 5:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:2">Bir 17:2</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 31:33">Yob 31:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka bakaita endagaano nka Adamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:7">Bandeebezayo.<verse eid="HOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 6:8" />Gileadi n'orurembo rw'enkozi z'ebibi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:8">Orusiisirwe eshagama.<verse eid="HOS 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 6:9" />Nk'oku abambuzi bagwera omuntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:9">Nikwo n'abanyamurwa beeteerana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:9">Bakaitira abantu omu muhanda ogurikuza Shekemu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:9">Eego, bakakorerayo eby'obushambani.<verse eid="HOS 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 6:10" />Ndeebire ekihagaro omu nju ya Israeli;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:10">Okwo niyo obwamaraaya bwa Efuraimu buri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:10">Israeli esiisikaire.<verse eid="HOS 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 6:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 42:10">Yob 42:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 126:1">Zab 126:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:13">Yoel 3:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi naiwe, Yuda, eigyesha rikuteereirweho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:11">Omu bunaku obu ndigaruriramu abantu bangye, nimbaiha omu bukwatwa.<verse eid="HOS 6:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HOS 7" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okworeka Abaefuraimu ebibi byabo ebitari bimwe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 23:13">Yer 23:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku mba niinyenda kutambira Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:1">Okutahikiirira kwa Efuraimu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:1">N'ebibi ebi Abasamaria barikukora bishuuruuka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:1">Ahabw'okuba bakora eby'obugobya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:1">Omushuma afumura enju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:1">Kandi aheeru omutwe gw'abambuzi gunyaga;<verse eid="HOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 7:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 5:22">Enf 5:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Haza tibateekateeka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:2">Ku nyowe nyijuka ebibi byona ebi bakora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:2">Hati ebi batuura nibakora bibeehinguriririize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:2">Kandi biri omu maisho gangye.<verse eid="HOS 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 7:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:32">Rom 1:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bashemeza omugabe n'obubi bwabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:3">N'abanyiginya bashemerererwa ebishuba byabo.<verse eid="HOS 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 7:4" />Boona n'enshambani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:4">Bari nk'ekyoma ky'okuteekamu emigaati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:4">Eki omuteeki waayo areka kwenegyezamu omuriro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:4">Okwiha aha kubumbabumba omugaati okuhitsya aha kutumba kwagwo.<verse eid="HOS 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 7:5" />Aha izooba ry'omugabe waitu abanyiginya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:5">Bakarwazibwa esindo y'amaarwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:5">Nawe yaatezya emikono n'abagaaniizi.<verse eid="HOS 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 7:6" />Ahabw'okuba emitima yaabo neebugumwamu enaama mbi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:6">Ekiniga kyabo kiraara nikyaka mpora-mpora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:6">Bukisheesha kyaka nk'omuriro gurikubuguma.<verse eid="HOS 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 7:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 8:4">Hos 8:4</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:10">2 Bag 15:10</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 15:14">14</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 15:25">25</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 15:30">30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Boona nibootsya nk'ekyoma ky'okuteekamu emigaati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:7">Bashonshomera abaramuzi baabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:7">Abagabe baabo boona bagwire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:7">Tihariho n'omwe omuribo orikuntakira.<verse eid="HOS 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 7:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 106:35">Zab 106:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Efuraimu naayejwanzya n'amahanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:8">Efuraimu ni nk'omugaati ogutahindwirwe.<verse eid="HOS 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 7:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 8:7">Hos 8:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:25">Isa 42:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abanyamahanga nibamumaramu amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:9">Kwonka we tarikukimanya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:9">Enju zimubarangaine omu mutwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:9">Kwonka we tarikukimanya.<verse eid="HOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 7:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 5:5">Hos 5:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:13">Isa 9:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amaryo ga Israeli nigo mushinja we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:10">Kwonka tibakagarukiraga MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:10">N'obu kwakuba okumusherura ahabw'ebyo byona.<verse eid="HOS 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 7:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 5:13">Hos 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:4">2 Bag 17:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Efuraimu ni nk'enkombe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:11">Efiire omutima, etaine bwengye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:11">Naatakira Misri, ahungira Asiria.<verse eid="HOS 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 7:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 28:15-68">Bir 28:15-68</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:13">Ezk 12:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku bariba nibagyenda, ndyabarengyezaho ekigoye kyangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:12">Kandi ndyabahanura nk'enyonyi z'omu mwanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:12">Mbahane ahabw'ebibi ebi barikukora.<verse eid="HOS 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 7:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 9:12">Hos 9:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryakareeba, ahabw'okuba barazire, bandugaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:13">Baryacwekyerera, ahabw'okuba bangomeire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:13">Nkaayenzire kubacungura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:13">Kwonka nibambeiherera.<verse eid="HOS 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 7:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:36">Zab 78:36</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 78:37">37</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 6:4">Amo 6:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tibarikuntakira baihire aha mutima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:14">Kureka nibaboroogyera aha bitanda byabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:14">Nibeeteeranira hamwe ahabw'engano na viinyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:14">Nyowe bangomera.<verse eid="HOS 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 7:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 11:3">Hos 11:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu ndaabe naabeegyeise, nkaha emikono yaabo amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:15">Kwonka banyiniire enaama mbi.<verse eid="HOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 7:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 9:3">Hos 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:57">Zab 78:57</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nibeehongyera Baali;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:16">Bari nk'obuta oburikureebya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:16">Abanyiginya baabo baryaitwa rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:16">Nibaturwa orubwa rw'endimi zaabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:16">Eki nikyo kiribashekyereza omu nsi ya Misri.<verse eid="HOS 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HOS 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ebifubiro ebi Ruhanga arita aha Baisraeli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 28:49">Bir 28:49</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ta enzamba aha munwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:1">Ahakuba eishamba nirizeereera aha nju ya MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:1">Ahabw'okuba baitsire endagaano yangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:1">Baashiisha ebiragiro byangye.<verse eid="HOS 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 8:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:21">Mat 7:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nibantakira nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:2">Ruhanga waitu, itwe Abaisraeli nitukumanya.<verse eid="HOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 8:3" />Israeli anagire ebirungi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:3">Omuzigu aryamuhiiga.<verse eid="HOS 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 8:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 13:5">2 Bus 13:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bakeemeka abagabe, ntabaragiire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:4">Baayeteeraho abategyeki, ntarikukimanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:4">Baakora ebishushani ebirikuramibwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:4">Omu feeza n'ezaabu zaabo kwecwekyereza.<verse eid="HOS 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 8:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 10:5">Hos 10:5</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 10:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 12:28">1 Bag 12:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Samaria, nyangire enyana yaawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:5">Ekiniga kyangye nikibaakaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:5">Baryahitsya hi okuguma batyo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:5">Batashemeziibwe omuri Israeli?<verse eid="HOS 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 8:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 1:6">Mik 1:6</ref>, <ref loc="MIC 1:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Egyo nyana ya Samaria ti Ruhanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:6">Omuheesi niwe yaagiheesire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:6">Eryacwagurika.<verse eid="HOS 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 8:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 7:9">Hos 7:9</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 10:13">10:13</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:8">Gal 6:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba nibabiba omuyaga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:7">Bwanyima baryagyesha akasooroora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:7">Omugusha gukuzire, tigwine bikumba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:7">Tigurirugamu njuma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:7">N'obu zaakurugamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:7">Abanyamahanga bakaazirya.<verse eid="HOS 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 8:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 17:6">2 Bag 17:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaisraeli bamizirwekwo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:8">Na mbwenu baahikire omu mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:8">Bari nk'ekintu kitaine mugasho.<verse eid="HOS 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 8:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 5:13">Hos 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:24">Yer 2:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba bainamukire Asiria,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:9">Ni nk'enturegye erikuzengyerera yonka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:9">Efuraimu aguriire nkunzi ze.<verse eid="HOS 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 8:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 26:7">Ezk 26:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu baraaguriirire ab'okubaha emikono omu mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:10">Kwonka ndyabateeranira hamwe juba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:10">Bamare omwanya mukye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:10">Batakishuka majuta aha bagabe n'aha banyiginya kubeemeka.<verse eid="HOS 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 8:11" />Ahabw'okuba Efuraimu akanyiise amatambiro g'okukoreraho ebibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:11">Ago matambiro gamuhindukiire ag'okukoreraho ebibi.<verse eid="HOS 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 8:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:6">Bir 4:6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 4:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kuri naamuhandikiire ebiragiro obukumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:12">Bikaateekateekirweho nk'eby'enduga-mahanga.<verse eid="HOS 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 8:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 9:9">Hos 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:68">Bir 28:68</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:21">Yer 7:21</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 8:7">Amo 8:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bakunda kutamba ebitambo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:13">Batamba enyana, bagirya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:13">Kwonka MUKAMA tabishemerererwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:13">Mbwenu naija kwijuka eby'okushiisha byabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:13">Abafubire ahabw'ebibi byabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:13">Bagarukye Misri.<verse eid="HOS 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 8:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 17:7">Isa 17:7</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:5">Amo 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:11">5:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba Israeli ayebirwe Omuhangi we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:14">Yaayeyombekyera zaanyaruju;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:14">Na Yuda akanyiise endembo ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:14">Kwonka ndyatweka omuriro omu ndembo ze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:14">Gwotsye ebigo bye.<verse eid="HOS 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HOS 9" />
  <para style="s1">Hosea okubahanuurira eby'okutwarwa omu bukwatwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 1:2">Hos 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:5">2:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:17">Yer 44:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Israeli 'we, otashemererwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:1">Oteesiima nk'agandi mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:1">Ahabw'okuba okaraaya, waatsigaho Ruhanga waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:1">Waakunda ebihembo by'obwamaraaya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:1">Aha mbuga zoona ezi bahuuriraho.<verse eid="HOS 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 9:2" />Kwonka eby'aha mbuga n'eby'omu manyuukiro ga viinyo tibiribatunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:2">Kandi na viinyo y'omutahe eryababurira.<verse eid="HOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 9:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 25:23">Lev 25:23</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 4:13">Ezk 4:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 8:13">Hos 8:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tibariguma mu nsi ya MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:3">Kureka Abaefuraimu baryagaruka Misri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:3">Kandi Asiria baryatungirwayo eby'okurya bitashemeire.<verse eid="HOS 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 9:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 26:14">Bir 26:14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 24:17">Ezk 24:17</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:13">Hag 2:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tibarishukira MUKAMA mpongano za viinyo ez'okunywa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:4">N'obu kwakuba okumugwisa gye n'ebitambo byabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:4">Eby'okurya byabo biryaba nk'eby'abari omu rufu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:4">Abaribiryaho boona baryasiisikara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:4">Ahabw'okuba eby'okurya byabo biryaba biri eby'okubatambira enjara kwonka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:4">Tibirishuuza mu nju ya MUKAMA.<verse eid="HOS 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 9:5" />Mbwenu muryakora ki aha izooba ry'okuteerana okurikwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:5">N'aha izooba ry'obugyenyi bwa MUKAMA?<verse eid="HOS 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 9:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:20">Isa 2:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba reeba, nibaza Asiria;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:6">Misri eryabarunda hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:6">Memufiisi ebaziikye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:6">Ebintu byabo by'efeeza eby'obuguzi bwingi biryashwekwa ebicurangyenyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:6">N'amahwa gamere omu mahema gaabo.<verse eid="HOS 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 9:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:3">Isa 10:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 13:3">Ezk 13:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obunaku bw'okufubirwa buhikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:7">Obunaku bw'okuhoorwa nabwo buhikire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:7">Israeli naija kukimanya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:7">Nabi n'omushema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:7">N'oriho omuzimu agwire eiraro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:7">Ahabw'eby'okushiisha byawe bingi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:7">N'orwango rwawe rwingi.<verse eid="HOS 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 9:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 5:1">Hos 5:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nabi niwe murinzi wa Efuraimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:8">Abantu ba Ruhanga wangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:8">Kwonka ei arikuza yoona hariyo omutego gw'omutegi w'enyonyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:8">N'omu nju ya Ruhanga we harimu obwangani.<verse eid="HOS 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 9:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 25:3">Kub 25:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 80:8">Zab 80:8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:28">Rom 1:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beesiisire barengyesereza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:9">Nk'omu biro bya Gibea;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:9">Aryaijuka eby'okushiisha byabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:9">Abafubire ahabw'ebibi byabo.<verse eid="HOS 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 9:10" />Nkashanga Israeli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">Ari nk'emizaabibu y'omu ihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">Naareeba baashwenkuriimwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">Bari nk'ebyana by'omutiini ogurikujigaija omu mwaka gwagwo ogw'okubanza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">Kwonka baahika Baali-peori,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">Baayehongyera Baali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">Baahinduka ekirikunugwa nk'ekyo kintu eki baakunzire.<verse eid="HOS 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 9:11" />Ekitiinisa kya Efuraimu kiryaguruka nk'enyonyi, kibure;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:11">Habure okuzaara, n'okugira enda, n'okubaka.<verse eid="HOS 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 9:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 13:16">Hos 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:15">1 Sam 28:15</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 28:16">16</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu baryorora abaana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:12">Ndyabareetera okufiisa, abaana baabo bahweho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:12">Eshi ku ndibatsigaho, baryakareeba!<verse eid="HOS 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 9:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 28:15">1 Sam 28:15</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 28:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 27:3">Ezk 27:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku ndikureeba, abaana ba Efuraimu bateereirweho okutwarwa omu bukwatwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:13">Efuraimu aryayebembera abaana be kuza kwitwa.<verse eid="HOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 9:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 23:29">Luk 23:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obahe, ai MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:14">Mbwenu noija kubaha ki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:14">Obahe okuguma nibarugwamu enda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:14">N'amabeere goomangataine.<verse eid="HOS 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 9:15" />Buri kibi kyabo nikishangwa omuri Gilugaali;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:15">Okwo niyo naabandiize kubanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:15">Ndyababinga omu nju yangye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:15">Ahabw'obubi bw'emicwe yaabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:15">Tindigaruka kubakunda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:15">Abategyeki baabo boona n'abagomi.<verse eid="HOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 9:16" />Abaefuraimu bateirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:16">Emizi yaabo eyomire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:16">Tibaryana byana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:16">N'obu baribyana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:16">Ndyaita abaana baabo abarikukundwa.<verse eid="HOS 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 9:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 28:64">Bir 28:64</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 28:65">65</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga wangye aryabacwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:17">ahabw'okutamuhurira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:17">Babe ebizengyerezi omu mahanga.<verse eid="HOS 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HOS 10" />
  <para style="s1">Okufubirwa kw'Abaisraeli ahabw'ebibi byabo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 16:22">Bir 16:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 80:8-11">Zab 80:8-11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Israeli n'omuzaabibu guyumbize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:1">Ogurikwana ebyana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:1">Ei agarukiire kwana ebyana bingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:1">Niyo agarukiire kwombeka amatambiro maingi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:1">Nk'oku ensi eyeyongyeire kweyombekyera enyomyo nungi.<verse eid="HOS 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 10:2" />Omutima gwabo ti gw'amazima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:2">N'ahabw'ekyo bashemereire kugiibwaho orubanja.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:2">MUKAMA aryasheenya amatambiro gaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:2">Acwekyereze enyomyo zaabo.<verse eid="HOS 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 10:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 12:12">1 Sam 12:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba hati nibaija kugira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:3">Titwine mugabe, ahabw'okutoorobera MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:3">Mbwenu omugabe akaatugasira ki?<verse eid="HOS 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 10:4" />Bagamba ebigambo bya busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:4">Baragaana endagaano nibarahira ebishuba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:4">Nikyo okucwa kubi emanja kwaza kumerera omu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:4">Nk'oku orumbugu rumera omu misiri ehingire.<verse eid="HOS 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 10:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 4:21">1 Sam 4:21</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 4:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 12:28">1 Bag 12:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abatuuzi ba Samaria nibaitwa obwoba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:5">Ahabw'enyana ya Besaveeni erikuramibwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:5">Abantu baayo baryagicurira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:5">N'abanyamurwa baayo bagiboroogyere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:5">Nibarizibwa ekitiinisa kyayo ekigirugireho.<verse eid="HOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 10:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 5:13">Hos 5:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eego, ekyo kintu kiryatwarwa Asiria</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:6">Kutoijerwa omugabe Yarebu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:6">Efuraimu aryakwatwa eshoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:6">Na Israeli ahemukye ahabw'ekishushani kye ekirikuramibwa.<verse eid="HOS 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 10:7" />Omugabe wa Samaria aryahwerekyerera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:7">Nk'ekishate ky'ekiti ekirikuzeereera aha maizi.<verse eid="HOS 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 10:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 12:30">1 Bag 12:30</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 8:14">Amo 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:30">Luk 23:30</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Kush 6:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Emyanya mikuru ya Aveeni ey'okuramizamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:8">Ekibi kya Israeli, eryacwekyerezibwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:8">Amahwa n'amatojo garyamera aha matambiro gaayo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:8">Batakire enshozi nibagira bati: Mutushwekye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:8">N'ebibungo bati: Mutugwere.<verse eid="HOS 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 10:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 9:9">Hos 9:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Israeli, okwiha omu biro bya Gibea otuura noocumura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:9">Okwo niyo baagumiriizemu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:9">Nimugira ngu orugamba tiruribahikiraho omuri Gibea?<verse eid="HOS 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 10:10" />Ndyateera abo bantu b'ebyegyengye, mbafubire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:10">Kandi amahanga garyateerana kubarwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:10">Ku bariba bafubiirwe ahabw'ekibi kyabo ekirimu bibiri.<verse eid="HOS 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 10:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 25:4">Bir 25:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Efuraimu akaba ari nk'enyana eyegyesiibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:11">Eyaabaire ekunda kuhuura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:11">Naasaasira ebitsya bye birungi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:11">Kwonka Efuraimu ogwo niinyija kumukorera omugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:11">Yuda ahingye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:11">Na Yakobo ayetabirire.<verse eid="HOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 10:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:8">Isa 45:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:3">Yer 4:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwebibire okuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:12">Mugyeshe embabazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:12">Mutabire endaara zaanyu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:12">Ahabw'okuba obunaku bw'okusherura MUKAMA buhikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:12">Abone kwija kubagwisaho enjura y'okujunwa.<verse eid="HOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 10:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 8:7">Hos 8:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mukahinga obubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:13">Mwagyesha okutahikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:13">Mwarya ebyana by'ebishuba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:13">Ahabw'okuba mukeesiga ebigaari byanyu by'orugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:13">N'obwingi bw'abarwani baanyu.<verse eid="HOS 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 10:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 13:16">Hos 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:3">2 Bag 17:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo haribeeraho omurabanamu gw'obweme omu bantu baanyu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:14">Kandi ebigo byanyu byona biryacwekyerezibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:14">Nk'oku Shalumaani yaacwekyereize Besarubeeli aha izooba ry'orugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:14">Obu abazaire baasingyerwa n'abaana baabo.<verse eid="HOS 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 10:15" />Okwo nikwo muritwazibwa, imwe nju ya Israeli 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:15">Nimuturwa obubi bwanyu oburengyesereize.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:15">Omugabe wa Israeli aryamarirwaho kimwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:15">Omushekye nigujuguta.<verse eid="HOS 10:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HOS 11" />
  <para style="s1">Rukundo ya Ruhanga aha bantu be abaamwimwire</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 14:4">Hos 14:4</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 4:22">Kur 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:8">Bir 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2:15">Mat 2:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Israeli ku yaabaire akiri omwana, nkamukunda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:1">Naayeta mutabani wangye kuruga Misri.<verse eid="HOS 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 11:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 2:13">Hos 2:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:1">13:1</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 13:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ei naagarukiire kubeeta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:2">Niyo baagarukiire kundugaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:2">Bakaguma nibatambira Baabaali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:2">Nibooterera ebishushani ebirikuramibwa obubaane.<verse eid="HOS 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 11:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 7:15">Hos 7:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:26">Kur 15:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:31">Bir 1:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hoona ninye naayegyeise Abaefuraimu kugyenda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:3">Nkabakiikira omu mikono;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:3">Kwonka tibaramanyire ku niinye naabatambiire.<verse eid="HOS 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 11:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:13">Lev 26:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24-29">Zab 78:24-29</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:3">Yer 31:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:44">Yoh 6:44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkabairiza haihi n'emigoye y'esaasi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:4">N'emirunga ya rukundo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:4">Nkababeera nk'orikuyuzya enkomo aha bitsya byabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:4">Nainama, naabagaburira.<verse eid="HOS 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 11:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 17:13">2 Bag 17:13</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 17:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryagaruka Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:5">Kandi Omuasiria niwe ariba omugabe waabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:5">Ahabw'okuba bangire kungarukira.<verse eid="HOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 11:6" />Endembo zaabo ziryaguubwaho rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:6">Ecwekyereze empimbi z'amarembo gaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:6">Ebamarireho omu bigo byabo.<verse eid="HOS 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 11:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 14:4">Hos 14:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu bangye bagwereire orubaju rw'okundugaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:7">Nikyo bateereirweho omugamba gw'obuhuuku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:7">Kandi tihaine origubaihaho.<verse eid="HOS 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 11:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 14:8">Kut 14:8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24">19:24</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 19:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:36">Bir 32:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Efuraimu, nimbaasa nta kukureka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">Iwe Israeli, nimbaasa nta kukuhayo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">Nimbaasa nta kukuhindura nka Aduma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">Nari kukugira, nk'oku naagizire Zeboimu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">Omutima gwangye nigwesikura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">Embabazi zangye enizeeyongyera kuntagatsa omutima.<verse eid="HOS 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 11:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 23:19">Kub 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 12:6">Isa 12:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tindikwija kukora nk'ekiniga kyangye kingi oku kiri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:9">Tindigaruka kucwekyereza Efuraimu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:9">Ahabw'okuba ndi Ruhanga, tindi muntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:9">Orikwera ori ahagati omuriimwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:9">Kandi tindiija kuhwerekyereza.<verse eid="HOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 11:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 31:4">Isa 31:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:30">Yer 25:30</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:16">Yoel 3:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryakuratira MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:10">Atsinde nk'entare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:10">Eego, aryatsinda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:10">Abaana be baije nibatetema, nibaruga oburengyerwa-izooba.<verse eid="HOS 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 11:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 60:8">Isa 60:8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:6">Zek 10:6</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 10:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryaija nk'enyonyi, nibatetema nibaruga Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:11">Baije nk'enkombe, nibaruga omu nsi ya Asiria.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:11">Kandi ndyabagarura omu maka gaabo,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HOS 11:11">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="HOS 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 11:12" />Efuraimu anyehinguririziise ebishuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:12">N'ab'enju ya Israeli baanyehinguririzisa obugobya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:12">Kwonka Yuda we naakimanywa Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:12">Kandi n'omwesigwa ahari Orikwera.<verse eid="HOS 11:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HOS 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okubaijutsya ebya Yakobo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 7:13">Hos 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:4">2 Bag 17:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaefuraimu nibatungwa omuyaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:1">Kandi eizooba ryona nibakuratira omuyaga gw'oburugwa-izooba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:1">Nibakanyisa ebishuba n'obubisha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:1">Nibaragaana endagaano n'Abaasiria,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:1">Kandi n'amajuta nigatwarwa omuri Misri.<verse eid="HOS 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 12:2" />MUKAMA naatonganisa Yuda, Kandi aryafubira Yakobo nk'oku emitwarize ye eri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:2">Amuzimuurire nk'oku ebi akozire biri.<verse eid="HOS 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 12:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 25:26">Kut 25:26</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 32:28">32:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akakwata ekitsintsiino kya mukuru we, akiri omunda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:3">Kandi ku yaabaire omushaija, yaahakanisa Ruhanga.<verse eid="HOS 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 12:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 28:13">Kut 28:13</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 28:19">19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eego, akahakanisa maraika, yaamusinga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:4">yaarira, kandi yaamweshengyereza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:4">Yaabugabugana na Ruhanga Beseeli;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:4">Okwo niyo Ruhanga yaagambiire nawe.<verse eid="HOS 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 12:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:15">Kur 3:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niwe MUKAMA, Ruhanga ow'amahe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:5">MUKAMA niryo iziina rye.<verse eid="HOS 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 12:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:12">Yoel 2:12</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 2:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:8">Mik 6:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu, ahabw'okuhwerwa Ruhanga waawe, garuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:6">Ohamire kimwe aha mbabazi n'amazima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:6">Kandi ogume otegyereze Ruhanga waawe.<verse eid="HOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 12:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 11:1">Enf 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 8:5">Amo 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 2:2">Mik 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:11">6:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Engobya eine eminzaani y'ebishuba etaruga mu ngaro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:7">Ekunda kuzimba.<verse eid="HOS 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 12:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 29:29">Bir 29:29</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 11:5">Zek 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:17">Kush 3:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Efuraimu agizire ati: Eshi ndi omutungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:8">Nyetungiire eitungo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:8">Kwonka eitungo rye ryona tiriribaasa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:8">Kumwihaho rubanja oru yaayereeteire.<verse eid="HOS 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 12:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:39-43">Lev 23:39-43</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 8:4-18">Neh 8:4-18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:9">Okwiha obu waabaire ori omu nsi ya Misri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:9">Ndyagaruka nkutuuze omu mahema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:9">Nk'omu biro by'obugyenyi obwatairweho.<verse eid="HOS 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 12:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 17:13">2 Bag 17:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkagamba na baanabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:10">Kandi niinye naakanyiise okworekwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:10">Nkagambira abantu enfumu nindaba omuri baanabi.<verse eid="HOS 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 12:11" />Ku haraabe hariho okutahikiirira omuri Gileadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:11">Buzimazima Abagileadi baryahinduka busha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:11">Ku baraabe nibatambira enimi omuri Gilugaali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:11">Amatambiro gaabo garyaba nk'ekirundo ky'amabaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:11">Agarunzire ahagati y'emisiri.<verse eid="HOS 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 12:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 28:5">Kut 28:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 29:20">29:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> (Yakobo akahungira omu nsi ya Aramu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:12">Okwo niyo Israeli yaakorereire omukazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:12">Akariisa entaama, ngu abone kushwera.)<verse eid="HOS 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 12:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:50">Kur 12:50</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 12:51">51</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Bir 18:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 77:20">Zab 77:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA akaiha Israeli Misri, yaamwihisayo nabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:13">Kandi nabi ogwo niwe yaamugumizeho.<verse eid="HOS 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 12:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 17:17">2 Bag 17:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Efuraimu akagwisa kubi munonga MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:14">N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA aryamureka, orubanja rw'okusheesha eshagama rumugumeho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:14">N'ebijumo bye abimugarureho.<verse eid="HOS 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HOS 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okubeemanyisa ku niwe Ruhanga waabo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 13:1" />Efuraimu ku yaabaire agamba, abantu batetema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:1">Ayetunguura omuri Israeli;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:1">Kwonka ku yaayereetsireho orubanja ahabwa Baali, yaafa.<verse eid="HOS 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 13:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:18">1 Bag 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:19">Isa 40:19</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 40:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:4">Zab 115:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi na hati nibakyeyongyera kushiisha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:2">Nibeeheeshera ebishushani ebiyagiibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:2">Ebishushani ebirikuramibwa ebirikukorwa omu feeza zaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:2">Byona nibikorwa abanyamyoga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:2">Nibagira bati: Mube nibyo mwatambira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:2">N'eihano, abantu kunywegyera enyana!<verse eid="HOS 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 13:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 6:4">Hos 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 1:4">Zab 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 68:2">68:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo baribeera nk'oruho rw'omu kasheeshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:3">Kandi nk'orume orutsya bukiri kare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:3">Nk'ebishushunga ebirikutuntumurwa akasooroora aha mbuga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:3">Nari nk'omwika ogurikuruga omu mahega.<verse eid="HOS 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 13:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:3">Kur 20:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:11">Isa 43:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:21">45:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:4">Okwiha obu waabaire ori omu nsi ya Misri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:4">Tihariho Ruhanga ondiijo ou murikumanya, kureka nyowe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:4">Kandi ahatari nyowe, tihariho ondiijo mujuni.<verse eid="HOS 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 13:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 2:7">Bir 2:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niinye naakumanyire obu waabaire ori omu ihamba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:5">Omu nsi y'omushana mwingi;<verse eid="HOS 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 13:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 4:7">Hos 4:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 8:12-14">Bir 8:12-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ku baariire, baiguta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:6">Baahaaga, emitima yaabo yaayetunguura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:6">N'ahabw'ekyo baanyebwa.<verse eid="HOS 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 13:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 5:14">Hos 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:6">Yer 5:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo ndibabeerera nk'entare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:7">Nkabagwera aha rubaju rw'omuhanda nk'engwe.<verse eid="HOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 13:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 17:8">2 Sam 17:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyabagurukira, mbagweho nk'edubu eyakirwe ebyana byayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:8">Ntaagure ebifuba byabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:8">Kandi okwo niyo ndibashonshomerera nk'entare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:8">Enyamaishwa mbi ekabataagura.<verse eid="HOS 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 13:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 33:26">Bir 33:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai bambe Israeli, mbwenu ku ndiba ninkucwekyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:9">N'oha oribaasa kukuha emikono?<verse eid="HOS 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 13:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 8:4">Hos 8:4</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 8:5">1 Sam 8:5</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 8:19">19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omugabe waawe ow'okukujuna arahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:10">Abanyiginya baawe boona ab'okukurinda barahi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:10">Abu waashabire oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:10">Mpa omugabe n'abanyiginya?<verse eid="HOS 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 13:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 8:22">1 Sam 8:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkakuha abagabe ngwirwe kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:11">Kandi naabaihaho nyine ekiniga kingi.<verse eid="HOS 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 13:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:17">Yob 14:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okutahikiirira kwa Efuraimu kukomire hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:12">N'ekibi kye kibiikirwe.<verse eid="HOS 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 13:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 19:3">2 Bag 19:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:8">Isa 13:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebisha by'omukazi orikurumwa nibiija ahabwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:13">Kwonka n'omwana otaine bwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:13">Ahabw'okuba hati takatandikire kushuuriza.<verse eid="HOS 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 13:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 25:8">Isa 25:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:19">26:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 9:10">Ezk 9:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:12">37:12</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:55">1 Kor 15:55</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimugira ngu ndyabacungura, mbaihe omu maani g'Okuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:14">Kandi mbacungure, mbakize Rufu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:14">Iwe Rufu 'we, ebibonaboneso byawe birahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:14">Iwe Kuzimu 'we, okucwekyereza kwawe kurahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:14">Tinkiine ku ndaabagirire esaasi.<verse eid="HOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 13:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 41:52">Kut 41:52</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:10">Ezk 17:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 19:12">19:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu yaakukurira gye omuri beene-ishe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:15">Omuyaga gw'oburugwa-izooba, omuyaga gwa MUKAMA, guryaija</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:15">Niguruga omu ihamba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:15">Enshuro ye eryayoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:15">N'eiziba rye riryakarangatana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:15">Guryamara omu mabiikiro ge</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:15">Ebintu byona eby'obuguzi bwingi.<verse eid="HOS 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 13:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 9:12">Hos 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 10:14">10:14</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:12">2 Bag 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:12">18:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Samaria eryagiibwaho orubanja rwayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:16">Ahabw'okuba ekagomera Ruhanga waayo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:16">Abantu baamwo baryaitwa rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:16">Abeereere baabo baryateerwa ahansi, bacwagurukye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:16">N'abakazi baabo abaine enda baryabafumurana.<verse eid="HOS 13:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="HOS 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okweshengyereza Israeli kumugarukira</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 14:1" />Iwe Israeli 'we, garuka ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:1">Ahabw'okuba akagwisibwa eby'okushiisha byawe.<verse eid="HOS 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 14:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 13:15">Heb 13:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:13">Zab 50:13</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 50:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mugyende n'ebigambo, mugarukire MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:2">Mumugire muti: Twiheho eby'okushiisha byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:2">Oyakiire ebirungi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:2">Naitwe nitwija kuhonga empongano z'eminwa yaitu erikuhimbisa.<verse eid="HOS 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 14:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:14">Zab 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:16">Isa 30:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 31:1">31:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Asiria teritujuna;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:3">Titurigyendera ha mbaraasi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:3">Titurigaruka kugira ebikozirwe emikono yaitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:3">Tuti: Muri baaruhanga baitu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:3">Ahabw'okuba omuriiwe nimwo efuuzi zishanga embabazi.<verse eid="HOS 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 14:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:22">Yer 3:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyabakiza okugaruka enyima kwabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:4">Mbakunde, bataine ki bahaire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:4">Ahabw'okuba tinkibainiire kiniga.<verse eid="HOS 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 14:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 6:3">Hos 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 92:12">Zab 92:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:6">Isa 27:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:2">35:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyabeera Israeli nk'orume,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:5">Arabye ebirabyo nk'emyangangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:5">Atsimbe emizi nka Lebanooni.<verse eid="HOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 14:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 52:8">Zab 52:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amataagi ge garyajanjamura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:6">Oburungi bwe bube nk'omuzeituuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:6">N'omugaju gwe gube nk'ogwa Lebanooni.<verse eid="HOS 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 14:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 91:1">Zab 91:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryagaruka, batuure ahansi y'ekicuucu kyangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:7">Baryabengyeya nk'omusiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:7">Barabye nk'omuzaabibu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:7">N'omugaju gwabo gube nk'ogwa viinyo ya Lebanooni.<verse eid="HOS 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 14:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 2:8">Hos 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:22">Isa 30:22</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:4">Yoh 15:4</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:5">5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Efuraimu aryagira ati: Kandi nkiine kakwate ki n'ebishushani ebirikuramibwa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:8">Mmwetabire, kandi ndyamutaho amaisho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:8">Ndi nk'omuberooshi guyumbize;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:8">Ebyana byawe niinye birugaho.<verse eid="HOS 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 14:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 107:43">Zab 107:43</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 10:29">Enf 10:29</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:12">Yer 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:10">Dan 12:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oine obwengye weena ayetegyereze ebyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:9">Oine okwetegyereza, abimanye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:9">Ahabw'okuba emihanda ya MUKAMA egororokire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:9">Kandi abahikiriire baryagigyenderamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:9">Kwonka abasiisi baryagigwamu.<verse eid="HOS 14:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 14" />
</usx>